  "instructions": "This batch is read-only. Fill only translation values in RESPONSE_FILE.",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:BAM9O_04",
      "source": "But the Dunedain will not fall easily.",
      "source_hash": "84e67d495783e3098b3ddf6e216b89332281a4ffb9b65f68127730529fbb3827",
      "entry_hash": "c6a95416f130fde1e6ebca2f72bb605c1c92336a589d7608938253667cce18f7",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:BAM9O_05",
      "source": "They have gathered all of their host and all of their allies for this battle.",
      "source_hash": "72201fcd746d926bff79bc52ce5f8d0387be9b1e7a2bce8bc2a3e18e5218f436",
      "entry_hash": "cc7f47454a156b32565b6c59e1fef2bcfa517261d7dc61742f71e96e11649c50",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:BAM9O_06",
      "source": "The last and decisive battle for the North is about to begin....",
      "source_hash": "96b9c16499b10d2ce9be7c6c2ebbb7bc2056ffa3993e1920ed56177e6245c71a",
      "entry_hash": "10cd5df358ef9273a433d9b2a55337089fb8683cd678338f4fc2442f2d76369a",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC10_01",
      "source": "The sharp spires of Mount Gundabad house several loosely allied tribes of orcs,",
      "source_hash": "b525087fac8fd212c87e26ce45fa31767346c42d3b2fac6446faebe8fe92866c",
      "entry_hash": "a85245f29d6fa5456808aa7baefca2834723685559a33b9a247eaff29fcab5fc",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC10_02",
      "source": "who dominate the scattered snow troll and goblin clans.",
      "source_hash": "2a70e75f09e7de6ea28cfc19a90eea810e719b5621c0aa44381efd45a57f25d8",
      "entry_hash": "40b4aad495e11d677f4a1560be0a95da0b7d37134513782f6313af8d567b5152",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC10_03",
      "source": "In order for the Witch-king to defeat the realms of Arnor, he needs the blood and iron of Gundabad.",
      "source_hash": "30b1df8413cdda6c2859486965a15ba9106b0b997feaa2318482243144edc666",
      "entry_hash": "fb5c55119bad76e710822e8bb4d67b23d895b8c138df577b8613c3c500f24986",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC11_01",
      "source": "But Angmar needs sword arms, not corpses.",
      "source_hash": "190040b69b3a659ca0fb96219de6c5b2c23bd367ff8535ea5bdc1b580a137002",
      "entry_hash": "540bb19ce7c294f7fe792aac7c10f114405b7dc25ad400d7f72d16fd227b7cee",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC11_02",
      "source": "Therefore, he will win by guile that which force would destroy.",
      "source_hash": "0c92067008a8934101ac770186d0956febe92156b11e9d777dd5a6ec46bc9141",
      "entry_hash": "51ebacc2fc17f633b7e1255b1fe8417f48d5241169e957ff729db3399f97bc19",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC12_01",
      "source": "A blade in the dark forces a gathering of the tribes to compete for the crown?",
      "source_hash": "df3c17b1c384192bcd62af60bc3cb382bd9a8f06b9b45b30fb06ae895dee5884",
      "entry_hash": "cd493b6b11429f5fd3fadd8b59329c0f4f5eae2d1958c9fe0399c69edd42cb8b",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC13_01",
      "source": "To this gathering, the Witch-king sends his most fearsome lieutenant, Rogash, Troll of the North,",
      "source_hash": "e88833f3f6d5636fd505da773a42aebfa46ba8962990b70ea367134d17f26171",
      "entry_hash": "0deaef7098060313e3acfeb740a29fedcb997083dcef736da638faaeb38ec6b7",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC13_02",
      "source": "to ensure that the orcs of Gundabad will heed the orders of the Iron Crown?",
      "source_hash": "fb5d1479fff9330b747bf8c7fc93ed4099b0c83b313ee9e9c62b5712e71b996e",
      "entry_hash": "ab7520f72943bf8f6aea663e62a53b6da49e0a5628b98afe2803c82bf68dca5f",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC14_01",
      "source": " Through the power and savagery of Rogash, Mount Gundabad has yielded.",
      "source_hash": "b04a6e92e11482459fc5c3da89cce92e85fb3f54991c725a9bb399f383a58238",
      "entry_hash": "631ccca0dfb2689980e4f09ecf4d845babc18e94a851b76ee945aad8de17b480",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC14_02",
      "source": "Now, legions of orcs fight under the command of the Thrall Masters of Angmar.",
      "source_hash": "327442d4bc1f61f81342e1e0c05afe1e36f543924e5cecba4f00d1e021fbffd7",
      "entry_hash": "d00168e5b2830b00e2b2fbd0e5f45d2858923b2592cd20ac9e0742a0c3512505",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SUBTITLE:CAC14_03",
      "source": "The hammer is forged at last, ready to smite the heirs of Elendil and lay their kingdoms low?",
      "source_hash": "dc58cf9ce14a7bd66ce1df8543a40abdea5210f63420da84664e5376eefca8d8",
      "entry_hash": "dba869c559ec08dbe78479c6b29e00fed341776d91e245d98d29e43bb8fb5f87",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
